<div class="wpproslider_t6_DIV_3L"><img width="64" height="64" alt="Avatar for Briauna Bergland" src="https://www.safarivet.com/wp-content/uploads/wprevslider/avatars/1788590287_608.jpg" class="wprev_avatar_opt wpproslider_t6_IMG_2"></div>
