<div class="indrevtxt wpproslider_t6_P_4 wprev_preview_tcolor1_T6">
<div class='readmoretextdiv indrevlineclamp' data-lines='3' data-revid='599'>				Safari Vet is amazing!!!  They saved my dog life with stem cells!!!<br />
Blue was at deaths door with IBD.  Nothing my vet or specialist vet tried helped.  He had constant diarrhea, throwing up, muscle wasting and towards the end terrible seizures for 8 months.<br />
I found Safari Vet could ship stem cells to my vet in Oregon.  He started to improve almost immediately!!!  He had 3 IV's of stem cells over 3 months.  Thank was over 4 years ago!!! he is on no medication except apoquel.  We recently found Blue had arthritis in all his joints.  He was limping and in pain.  I was able to get stem cell injections from Safari Vet for his joints!  No more limping, just jumping for joy!!!<br />
I'm so grateful God sent me to Safari Vet!  Melinda and Dr. Garner<br />
are so helpful and compassionate.  I highly recommend their stem cell services!!!</div>
