<div class="indrevtxt wpproslider_t6_P_4 wprev_preview_tcolor1_T6">
<div class='readmoretextdiv indrevlineclamp' data-lines='3' data-revid='598'>				Dr Garner and his staff are so genuine and caring! From front desk staff to vet staff to vet, its a wonderful experience. They break down the diagnosis, treatment plan and continued care very well and in terms you understand without making you feel small.<br />
They remember your name and the pets name and welcome you with sweet smiles.<br />
Forever a believer that not all vets are the same and Safari sets the bar high!<br />
My Yoshi Woshi always receives the best care from his aunties and uncles here</div>
