<div class="indrevtxt wpproslider_t6_P_4 wprev_preview_tcolor1_T6">
<div class='readmoretextdiv indrevlineclamp' data-lines='3' data-revid='580'>				Safari Vet Care is fantastic! Our Sophia needed a special procedure, and Safari is one of only three locations in Texas offering it. Everyone at Safari is so friendly and helpful. They made sure Sophia was comfortable during her stay and Dr. Garner explained everything to me before and after her procedure was done.  Melinda is awesome!  She walked me through the registration procedure and got us scheduled in perfect time (we live nearly two hours away). Lisa is so sweet; she received us when we arrived, assisted with everything along the way, and made sure we had everything we needed when we left.  Thank you to Safari for everything and Kudos to you all!</p>
<p>P.S. I loved the Lord of the Rings room designs, very cool!</p></div>
