<div class="wpproslider_t6_DIV_1a">
<div class="indrevdiv wpproslider_t6_DIV_2 wprev_preview_bg1_T6 wprev_preview_bradius_T6">
<div class="wpproslider_t6_DIV_2_top">
<div class="wpproslider_t6_DIV_3L" ><img width="64" height="64" loading="lazy" src="https://www.safarivet.com/wp-content/uploads/wprevslider/avatars/1784189045_563.jpg" alt="Tisha De Hoyos Avatar" class="wpproslider_t6_IMG_2 wprevpro_avatarimg" /></div>
<div class="wpproslider_t6_DIV_3">
<div class="t6displayname wpproslider_t6_STRONG_5 wprev_preview_tcolor2_T6">Tisha De Hoyos</div>
<div class="wpproslider_t6_star_DIV"><span class="wprevpro_star_imgs_T6"><span class="starloc1 wprevpro_star_imgs wprevpro_star_imgsloc1"><span class="svgicons svg-wprsp-star"></span><span class="svgicons svg-wprsp-star"></span><span class="svgicons svg-wprsp-star"></span><span class="svgicons svg-wprsp-star"></span><span class="svgicons svg-wprsp-star-o"></span></span></span></div>
<div class="wpproslider_t6_SPAN_6 wprev_preview_tcolor2_T6"><span class="wprev_showdate_T6">7/16/2026</span></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class=" wpproslider_t6_DIV_4">
<div class="indrevtxt wpproslider_t6_P_4 wprev_preview_tcolor1_T6">
<div class='readmoretextdiv indrevlineclamp' data-lines='3' data-revid='563'>				My birds vet hands down AMAZING!! Against all odds, she saved my bird’s life. I’m eternally grateful. 4 stars only because when I brought my dog in yesterday, another vet was talking loud in the back and told the tech I wasn’t getting my money back.</p>
<p>Context: I had asked they predose my dog because he’s had allergic reactions to vaccines in the past. They forgot. No big deal. I asked if they could go ahead and do that. The extra charge was $23 and that was fine. I made no dispute about any of this transaction. So the comment from the vet (I’m assuming it was the vet) was out of left field and not called for. I wasn’t acting as if I was going to be difficult. I understood the miscommunication. I just wanted to make<br />
sure my dog would be ok and that he wouldn’t have a reaction on the way home. The vet clinic would by closed by then because this was the last appointment for the day.</p>
<p>When the vet tech came back with my pup, I said jokingly “I can’t get my money back?”  The vet tech replied “Oh you heard that?”  And yes, yes I did. Before making off handed comments they ought to be situationally aware of what they sound like to the person listening.</p>
<p>Other than that, is this a great clinic? HANDS DOWN ABSOLUTELY! My animals love the people here. That’s why the 4 stars and not 5. I think I’ll wait for my dogs regular vet next time. And I’ll continue to come here. And next time I’m hoping my visit won’t include the snarky remarks from the back. Although I’m sure misguided opinions on my character are given out for free, at least wait until I leave to express it, and act professional and friendly in the meantime. The receptionist rocks btw!! He made the experience better as I was walking out.</p></div>
<div class='divwprsrdmore' style='opacity:0;'><span class='wprevpro_btn_show_rdpop'>read more</span><span class='wprs_rd_less' style='display:none;'>read less</span></div>
</p></div>
</p></div>
<div class="wpproslider_t6_DIV_3_logo"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKTUxWbEVORWxFYjJnMlIxZFRaMFJYVEVWMFlrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x84ea120df277c840!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkJMLVlENElEb2g2R1dTZ0RXTEV0YkE%7C%7C?hl=en-US" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer" class="wprevpro_t6_site_logo_a"><img width="32" height="32" src="https://www.safarivet.com/wp-content/plugins/wp-review-slider-pro/public/partials/imgs/google_small_icon.svg" alt="Google Logo" class="wprevpro_t6_site_logo wprevsiteicon "></a></div>
</p></div>
</div>
